{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal model using PCA and ResNet50 encoders, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5232 and F1 of 0.5084, slightly lower than the concat fusion baseline (llm_summary_001). The results suggest weighted fusion may have a marginal impact, but the small performance difference could reflect variability rather than a definitive effect of the fusion method. The contribution of fusion type versus other factors remains uncertain without further comparative analysis."
}

